CCTPBridgeModuleFactory_Create
├── when called by any address
│   ├── it should deploy a new CCTPBridgeModule contract
│   ├── it should deploy a module reporting the CCTP_BRIDGE module type
│   ├── it should wire the module to the factory chain config
│   ├── it should register the module in the factory
│   ├── it should increment the module count
│   └── it should emit a CCTPBridgeModuleCreated event naming the deployer
└── when called multiple times
    ├── it should deploy distinct instances
    ├── it should register all instances in order
    └── it should wire every instance to the same chain config
